	<h6 data-zesty-id="content:text:5:66"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><u>here's how we delivered in 2024...</u></span></h6>
	<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:6:82">
	<em><strong>Scroll to Bottom for Photo samples and Sponsor Banner&nbsp;</strong></em><br>
	&nbsp;
</p>
	<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:7:29">AD Runs in the Richmond Times-Dispatch</h5>
	<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:8:43">
	<li>Friday, August 23 - Quarter&nbsp;Page AD Run (<a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/f46c4760-586b-4feb-afd9-bc7ea6cb5d87_RTD+8.23.24+AD+Clip.pdf">View AD</a>)<br>
	&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Sunday, September 1 - Half Page AD Run (<a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9ed6dd58-31e4-4495-8393-944853e9c8d8_RTD+9.1.24+AD+Clip.pdf">View AD</a>)<br>
	&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Thursday, September 12 &amp; Sunday, September 15 - Half Page AD Run (<a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/599b6620-e11b-4fbc-acee-ae2960db1c8d_RTD+9.15.24+AD+Clip.pdf">View AD</a>)<ul>
		<li>Half Page AD included in spadea at the annual Richmond Times-Dispatch THE BEST&nbsp;awards show, with 800 copies printed and distributed to attendees.</li>
		<li>Half Page AD ran in Special Edition on&nbsp;Sunday, September 15.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
	<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:9:82"></div>
	<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:11:91">Paid Facebook ADs</h5>
	<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:12:57">
	<li>13-day AD run</li>
	<li>Reached 6,684 accounts</li>
	<li>Resulted in: <strong>291 Post engagements </strong>and <strong>269 link clicks</strong></li>
</ul>
	<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:13:84"></div>
	<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:15:24">Onsite and Year-Round Visibility</h5>
	<ul data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:16:40">
	<li><strong>ONSITE:</strong> (3) 10 x 3 ft banners displayed at the race (see photos below)
<ul>
		<li>(2) on the finisher barricades</li>
		<li>(1) on the pop-up tent by the step and repeat<br>
		&nbsp;</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Physical Footprint</strong><ul>
		<li>Race t-shirts worn and seen around town (see photo below or post of&nbsp;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=905066014989822&amp;set=gm.1018802169991841&amp;idorvanity=939360217936037" target="">t-shirt on social media</a>)</li>
		<li>(50) Yard signs displayed around Greater Richmond</li>
		<li>All (3) banners will be displayed at The Salvation Army Boys &amp; Girls Club of Richmond (3701 R Street)<ul>
			<li>(2) will be hung on fence enclosing the outdoor play are</li>
			<li>(1) will be hung under the score board in the gym<br>
			&nbsp;</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><strong>YEAR-ROUND: Digital Footprint (<span style="color:#22b573;"><em>sponsor company name&nbsp;tagged, as available, in all social media posts</em></span>)</strong><ul>
		<li>Event recap and photos on our <a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/centralvirginia/past-events#Run-for-Hope-Sept-14-2024" target="">Past Events webpage</a></li>
		<li>Social media posts and reels on Facebook</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.909422491220841&amp;type=3" target="">Facebook Event Album</a>&nbsp;and <a href="https://www.facebook.com/reel/8118624761518098" target="">Pre-Event Reel</a> (already 2.5K plays between all platforms)</li>
		<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/posts/salarmyrva_rva-rva-peoplepowered-activity-7242167740059332608-bTz8?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop" target="">LinkedIn Event Album</a></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>
